   "note": "Product page and manual Appendix B agree: 1.7 x 17.2 x 25.6 in, 43 x 437 x 650 mm on the page, 1U, chassis CSE-815BTS-R000WNP. 437 is the body between the ear folds on both photographs. No document says what the depth runs between."
