   "note": "Manual figure 1-1 and its Storage Drive Numbers table: 0 to 3, left to right. Nothing is printed on the metal beside the bays that the photograph resolves, and it does resolve the control panel's 1.4 mm digits, so no bay numerals are drawn."
  },
  "ears": {
